econds that  passed by for over 3,700 years and they  converted those seconds into years and  days and he even did this while thinking  about other things why did he need to do  all that counting  well besides flexing his brainpower and  discipline mind he did it so he'd know  when it was spring since if he woke up  in winter being naked and without food  it would have immediately been game over  even though something so ridiculous  happened like everyone on the planet  turned into stone Zankou managed to keep  his cool and logically think about the  situation from the very first second as  a stone statue he kept his mind focused  for over 3,700 years something I don't  think anyone else could do keep in mind  not only did he count he counted the  seconds precisely something that is very  hard to do on its own even up to one  minute let alone 3,700 years then he  converted those precise seconds into  precise years and days accounting for  leap years and everything else so yeah  he's insanely smart but what makes him  even better is that he's like Albert  Einstein crossed with an insanely  charismatic rock star not only does he  have scientific knowledge  it also excites him to no end it makes  his life exhilarating I feel like I  would have enjoyed science class much  more in elementary school if I had sanku  as a role model back then another epic  cycle moment is when Tsukasa takes  usually huh hostage he wants sanku and  his scientific knowledge to be a race  from this world but not before sank who  gives him the formula for restoring  people Tsukasa wants to create a new and  ideal world without the corruption of  the old civilized world  he's like a stone-age Kira in that sense  like Kira he also doesn't have real  friends that can be used as hostages  while cenk who has tied you and by  extension you Surya who can be used as  bargaining chips for that reason Tsukasa  thinks that his victory against sanku is  assured he tells sanku to tell him the  recipe for the reviving formula or he'll  kill usually huh so it seems like sanku  has two options here keep the secret  the reviving formula and watch usually  ha die or tell the secret if he tells  the secret he will no longer serve any  purpose for Tsukasa  so he'll be killed instead of usury ha  at the face of it it seems like a  lose-lose situation  Zankou decides to reveal the formula to  save usury ha and then su casa gives him  one more chance he offers to let him  live if sanku promises to turn his back  on science psycho can easily lie as he  points out but he says that he won't do  that  and then Tsukasa gives him a mortal  wound the fight between brains and brawn  seems to be over and in this stone world  brawn has won it seems like Tsukasa has  gotten everything he wanted oh except  sanku was actually several steps ahead  of Tsukasa the whole time and in truth  sanku is the one who got everything he  wanted previously cenk who noticed the  restoration abilities under the  petrification process he had some of the  stone still left on the back of his head  he regularly touched the back of his  head in a way where ty drew and use  levitra would notice it was a clue tide  you knew him well and he knew that he  never used to do that that is how they  thought to look at the back of his head  and figure out that he wasn't completely  d petrified so they poured some of the  reviving formula on him and he came back  to life just as planned  he used his intelligence to resurrect  himself after being killed  not even L could do that not only did he  escape from tsukasa's Lulu's ultimatum  by getting away with his life and  usually has life he even gained the  invaluable advantage of tricking Tsukasa  into thinking that he had killed him as  sanku points out this gives them a great  military advantage while Tsukasa thinks  that Senko is dead  sinc who will know where to cosa is the  whole time since ty Joe and yuzu Rika  will act as spies in the meantime sanku  will find more comrades and make  scientific advancements that will help  him ultimately defeat Tsukasa these  advantageous conditions could never have  been achieved if sanku hadn't planned  out his own death so well not only was  Tsukasa sluices ultimatum circumvented  the whole ultimatum itself was part of  Sega's plan from the beginning  and rather than hurting him it served as  an important stepping stone towards the  advancement of  own plants sanku didn't just think  outside the box  he created the box and trapped his  opponent in it and it truly was  exhilarating and that is it for today's  video thank you so much for watching and  remember if we hit 4,000 likes I'm gonna  have the next installment published  within a week so if you enjoy these  videos and want to see the next one soon  make sure to smash that like button and  share this video with anyone who might  enjoy watching geniuses at their best  which to be fair should be everyone if  you still haven't be sure to subscribe  and ring that notification bell so you  actually get notified when new videos  come out for more anime greatness false  on twitter and instagram at anime uproar  a big thank you goes out to our patrons  over on patreon who help make videos  like this one possible I especially want  to thank our pro hero tier patrons the  one and only Gilgamesh nothing but a fan  Jason Wilson Kings outdress angel Cruz  Steelers and Pablo Pablo and the one  tier patrons the ones who stand atop all  clans baby ray 817 f f DP Steven and  Greta allall on automatic Mac 239  makoto-kun Keylong and Enrico dames and  the patrons who transcend greatness  itself Regan Harrison Lord naksan or the  chosen few who have been acknowledged by  Lords we go himself if you enjoy our  work you can support more of it by going  over to patreon calm animals or and  becoming a patron today for as little as  $1 if you do so you'll get your name  featured in future videos alongside  these geniuses right here and you'll  even get access to